.git
.gitignore
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/.wrangler
**/coverage
**/TestResults

# Local environment and credential files must never enter the Docker build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
**/rclone.conf
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/*service-account*.json
**/*service_account*.json
**/application_default_credentials.json
